    "group": "Canoptek Court",
    "summary": "The Power Matrix always covers your own deployment zone. At each phase start, check No Man’s Land and the opposing deployment zone separately. Add each region for that phase if you hold half or more of its objectives. For a friendly CRYPTEK or CANOPTEK attacker, a 1 to hit is re-rolled. If the model’s unit is wholly inside the Power Matrix, a re-roll is available on any Hit roll instead.",
